title: "dossier-preflight"
abstract: >-
  Checks a dossier of scanned administrative forms for the defects that get it rejected at the
  counter, measured on what is actually printed, with detector thresholds calibrated on a
  synthetic degradation grid and their failure modes published next to them.
type: software
